    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d384-a1-a4">

                <pb facs="0733" n="671" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg671"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Muzquiz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1878-03-01"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 1,
                        1878</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>According to the provisions of article 344 of the organic law governing criminal
                    cases, Juan Nieto and Pánfilo Bativerres are declared to be under arrest for
                    good cause. Let them be notified, and also the jailer. The local judge of the
                    second court, Victoriano Rodriguez, issued and signed this, with assisting
                    witnesses. We certify.</p>
                <closer><signed>VICTORIANO RODRIGUEZ.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Assisting witnesses:<lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps">M.
                            Guajardo</hi>.<lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps">Julian Rios</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Next, Juan Nieto, and Pánfilo Bativerres, and the jailer, Toribio Gutierrez,
                        being present, were notified of the foregoing, and did not sign, not knowing
                        how. We certify.</p>
                    <closer><signed>VICTORIANO RODRIGUEZ.</signed></closer>
                    <postscript>
                        <p>Assisting witnesses:<lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps">Julian
                                Rios</hi>.<lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps">M. Guajardo.</hi></p>
                    </postscript>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
